-m\">我；我（女性或年长者用语）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"221008\">この<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、あたしをどなりつけるんですよ！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这家伙冲我大喊大叫!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖かい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたたかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">温暖；温和；（令人舒适的）炎热；体贴；亲切；和蔼；（颜色）温暖的；柔和的；手头宽裕；富裕</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203062\">だんだん<ruby>暖<rp>(</rp><rt>あたた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かくなります。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它会越来越温暖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖まる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたたまる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">变暖；暖和；温暖起来；晒太阳取暖</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"127293\"><ruby>暖<rp>(</rp><rt>あたた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>まるまでエンジンをかけておきなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">运行引擎,直到它变暖。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暖める</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたためる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">加热；温热；酝酿；珍藏（想法等）；反复思考；重续；重新恢复（旧友谊）；据为己有；自己占有</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195031\">ミルクを<ruby>温<rp>(</rp><rt>あたた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>めてくれませんか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你能把牛奶热一下吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">頭</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">头；头部；头发；头脑；思维；智力；领导；首领；头目；队长；顶端；顶部；尖端；开始；起始；人头；人；首付；预付款；定金；汉字的上部部件；（麻将）雀头；将牌</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229971\">アリスは<ruby>頭<rp>(</rp><rt>あたま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>花<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をさしています。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">爱丽丝头发里有朵花</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">新しい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたらしい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n5\" href=\"../n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">新的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>靴<rp>(</rp><rt>くつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>買<rp>(</rp><rt>か</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">买了新鞋。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">当たり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">击中；命中；成功；猜测；推测；和蔼；友善；感觉；触感；（水果上的）淤伤；（围棋）打吃；叫吃（某子或连通的数子下一步可被提吃）；（鱼的）咬钩；上钩；每；每个</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"187531\"><ruby>何回<rp>(</rp><rt>なんかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>か<ruby>当<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たりはあったが<ruby>針<rp>(</rp><rt>はり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にはかからなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我被咬了几口,但不能钓鱼</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">辺り</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたり</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">邻近；附近；周围；近处；左右；上下；约莫；比如；譬如；类似</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"142435\"><ruby>昔<rp>(</rp><rt>むかし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>この<ruby>辺<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りにホテルがあったんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这儿以前有家酒店</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あたりまえ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">自然的；合理的；明显的；通常的；常见的；普通的；平常的；常态</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"219403\">この<ruby>問題<rp>(</rp><rt>もんだい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はあたりまえのやり<ruby>方<rp>(</rp><rt>かた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>では<ruby>解決<rp>(</rp><rt>かいけつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这个问题不能用普通的办法解决。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/339224\" title=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · nickyeow\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">当たる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あたる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">被击中；被打到；接触；碰到；贴附；相当于；适用于；符合；说得准；批评中肯；中签；抽中；获胜；成功；顺利；受欢迎；面向；对着；相对；位于（某方向）；在……方向；承担；被分配；（因食物、暑热等）中毒；中暑；受害；被点名；被提问；苛待；（对人）撒气；冲……发火；（用于否定，如「するには当たらない」）不必；用不着；（棒球）击球手感好；连续安打；鱼儿咬钩；有鱼讯；（水果等）碰伤；变质腐烂；试探；探查；对比检查；剃；刮；与某人有亲缘关系；是某人的……</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"157780\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>顔<rp>(</rp><rt>かお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>冷<rp>(</rp><rt>つめ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たい<ruby>風<rp>(</rp><rt>かぜ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>当<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たるのを<ruby>感<rp>(</rp><rt>かん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我脸上有阵寒风</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あちこち</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">代词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">代名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">到处；各处；四面八方；到处都是；混乱；混杂；顺序颠倒；颠三倒四</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"81665\"><ruby>本<rp>(</rp><rt>ほん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>部屋<rp>(</rp><rt>へや</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のあちこちに<ruby>散<rp>(</rp><rt>ち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らばっていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">里面有关于房间的书</span></div></li>"]